From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v-zhangxiaomeng5 <v-zhangxiaomeng5@xiaomi.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 23:59:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] from_chars_floating_point.h: replace llvm-libc shared headers
 with from_chars_support.h

llvm-21's from_chars_floating_point.h implementation depends on 3 llvm-libc shared headers which pull in 146 internal header files. Add a self-contained from_chars_support.h(under nuttx repo) that delegates actual float parsing to nuttx strtof/strtod, replacing the 146-file dependency tree.
Known limitations of from_chars_support.h:
- Correctness depends on system strtod quality
- Extremely long inputs (500+ digits) may lose precision due to mantissa truncation during the mantissa->string->strtod round-trip
- Overflow boundary rounding may differ from IEEE 754 strict compliance

Signed-off-by: v-zhangxiaomeng5 <v-zhangxiaomeng5@xiaomi.com>
---
 src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h | 15 ++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h b/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h
index 19eeeb28fb..9cbabcd106 100644
--- a/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h
+++ b/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h
@@ -9,11 +9,6 @@
 #ifndef _LIBCPP_SRC_INCLUDE_FROM_CHARS_FLOATING_POINT_H
 #define _LIBCPP_SRC_INCLUDE_FROM_CHARS_FLOATING_POINT_H
 
-// These headers are in the shared LLVM-libc header library.
-#include "shared/fp_bits.h"
-#include "shared/str_to_float.h"
-#include "shared/str_to_integer.h"
-
 #include <__assert>
 #include <__config>
 #include <cctype>
@@ -24,6 +19,16 @@
 // Included for the _Floating_type_traits class
 #include "to_chars_floating_point.h"
 
+// Included if llvm-libc/shared/ presents,
+// otherwise include libxx/libcxx/from_chars_support.h
+#if __has_include("shared/fp_bits.h")
+#include "shared/fp_bits.h"
+#include "shared/str_to_float.h"
+#include "shared/str_to_integer.h"
+#else
+#include "from_chars_support.h"
+#endif
+
 _LIBCPP_BEGIN_NAMESPACE_STD
 
 // Parses an infinity string.
